  "CardHelpSection": {
    "ParentObjectID": "advanced_copper_tools_copper_nails",
    "LocalizationKey": "Advanced_Copper_Tools_CopperNails_CardHelpSection",
    "DefaultText": "<b>Crafted:</b> From a copper, tin or bronze nugget using a hammer, or six at a time by casting a heated copper, tin or bronze bar (one mud brick and one clay as the mould); iron nails are forged from 4 iron nuggets with a hammer (Forge Iron Nails, 4 nails). The nail is the metal of its nugget or bar.\n\n<b>Uses:</b> Construction and crafting. A nail of any metal works the same in every recipe, iron included.\n\n<b>Smelts:</b> Returns 1 nugget of its own metal in a furnace at 1100\u00b0C or hotter."
  },
